{
  "$schema": "../../scenario.schema.json",
  "id": "reentrancy/direct-updates-from-a-room-s-work-draw-no-hook-call",
  "title": "Direct updates a message's parse, a locked hook, a delivery and a turn make, each more than the cascade's hook calls, all succeed; an ASYNC hook body's still draw all of them and stop at reentry_loop_cap",
  "rules": [
    "§10.3 A direct change from the room's work",
    "§8.3",
    "§9.5.1"
  ],
  "requirements": [
    "RK-10.3-061",
    "RK-8.3-041"
  ],
  "reentrancy": [
    "change@admitted",
    "change@cascade",
    "change@locked"
  ],
  "notes": "max_chain_depth is 2, so the cascade has 20 hook calls (and the agent answers at depth 1, within the limit). ws's parse (an admission), the SYNC BEFORE_BROADCAST hook (a locked section), sms's delivery and the agent's turn each make 21 direct updates of the first message, which all succeed. The AFTER_BROADCAST body's updates then find the 20 hook calls whole: its twenty-first raises. No ON_EVENT_UPDATED hook is registered, so the updates' triggers draw nothing.",
